  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://minecraftonly.com/uploads/posts/2025-09/1757083236_meijun.png\" alt=\"最新Mod 方块模组适用于Minecraft 1.16.5 forge » 第8页 » MinecraftOnly\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">!白天，你将独自生存，但夜晚它们（就是<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>它們</strong></span>）会刷新，有些能骗你！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">!它很快殺了你，也會用假追蹤騙你！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><em>作者不喜歡模型盜竊或重製更好的版本，但在我許可的情況下是有可能的。</em></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>!!!警告：MOD使用自然敵對生物生成，別把它關掉！！！<br>!!!警告2：MOD在多人模式和冒險模式下無效！！！</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>靈感來自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-boiled-one-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underlin\">The Boiled One</span></strong></a> MOD</p>\n<p>追逐主題：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftuna.voicemod.net%252fsound%252f34fb6d93-14b0-4029-bbcc-352b0c9f75e6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>FuwattiBlockman</strong></a></p>\n<p>創建於:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://mcreator.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCreator</a>&nbsp;</span>+&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ilyahopal228/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ilyahopal228</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">預告：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>實體：</p>\n<p>煮沸者、煮沸者追隨者、煮沸者假追蹤。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>學術自由許可證（AFL v.3.0）／保留所有權利</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">the</span> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1606/273/639037048699128716.png\"></strong></p>",
